openmediavault-example (8.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Compose mode now follows the openmediavault-compose conventions
    (same pattern as omv-immich 8.0.7): the plugin no longer renders
    .env / docker-compose.yml itself. On save the RPC registers or
    updates the stack through the Compose RPC (Compose.setFile), so it
    lives in the Compose plugin shared folder as
    <compose shared folder>/example/example.yml + example.env and shows
    up in the Compose web UI; switching back to systemd mode removes
    the registration again (Compose.deleteFile).
    - The 'composeDirRef' (stack files shared folder) property and the
      example.env.j2 / example.compose.yml.j2 templates are gone; the
      Salt state only runs the lifecycle through the Compose plugin
      helper omv-compose-run (up/down) and skips everything while the
      Compose plugin shared folder is not configured.
    - The ctl helper resolves the stack from the Compose plugin
      settings and adds an 'unregister' action (used by prerm).
    - openmediavault-compose is a dependency; remove it if you derive a
      systemd-only plugin from this template.

 -- fffeng99999 <fffeng99999@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 07 Oct 2026 19:00:00 +0800

openmediavault-example (8.0.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the CI lint failure: plain scalars in workbench YAML must not
    contain a colon followed by a space, so reword three hint texts
    (the official component files avoid colons inside _() strings
    for the same reason). The v8.0.2 deb was never released because
    of this lint error.
  * Ship omv-example-ctl and the confdb create.d script with the
    executable bit (Windows checkouts lose the bit, which would
    break first-install configuration).

 -- fffeng99999 <fffeng99999@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 06 Oct 2026 19:10:00 +0800

openmediavault-example (8.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the "Open Example" button: URI-encode the generated external
    URL with the encodeuricomponent filter. Without encoding the URL
    contains slashes, which do not match the single-segment
    externalRedirect/:url workbench route and the click ends on the
    404 page. Same fix as immich 8.0.3.

 -- fffeng99999 <fffeng99999@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 06 Oct 2026 18:30:00 +0800

openmediavault-example (8.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Template skeleton release: full standard plugin structure for
    OpenMediaVault 8.x.
    - Datamodel (conf.service.example) + confdb create script +
      engined RPC service (get/set/start/stop/restart/getLog) +
      engine module (services panel status).
    - Salt state with two integration modes switchable from the
      settings page: systemd service (renders example.conf and
      example.service, manages the unit) and Docker Compose stack
      (renders .env and docker-compose.yml into the compose
      directory, manages the stack).
    - Declarative Workbench pages (navigation page + settings form
      page with status fields, mode select and taskDialog buttons)
      and Simplified/Traditional Chinese translations.
    - GitHub Actions CI: lint + dpkg-buildpackage + Release.

